# Every file here is read by bash or by node, and both of them are usually
# running under WSL or Linux even when the checkout is on Windows. A CRLF
# working copy makes `bash scripts/run.sh` fail with `set: pipefail\r: invalid
# option name` and takes the whole suite down with it, so line endings are the
# repository's business rather than the machine's autocrlf setting.
* text=lf eol=lf
